Alertify - Back in Stock WooCommerce Alerts & Email Notifications

== Description ==

**Alertify** is advanced back-in-stock notification system for WooCommerce, helping store owners increase conversions by notifying customers when their favorite products are restocked. 
Alertify is a powerful back-in-stock notification plugin for WooCommerce designed to boost customer engagement and recover lost sales. With automatic email notifications, customers can subscribe to their favorite out-of-stock products and receive instant alerts when the items are back in stock.

With this plugin, you can effortlessly manage notifications, customize email templates, and ensure that customers stay informed about product availability. 
Whether you're selling physical goods or digital downloads, Alertify is the ultimate solution for WooCommerce stores to improve conversions and customer satisfaction.


==Key Benefits==

* Build customer loyalty with timely stock availability alerts.
* Capture lost sales by letting customers subscribe to out-of-stock products.
* Fully customizable and optimized for performance.

With Alertify, you can deliver email notifications for **back-in-stock WooCommerce** products effortlessly. Whether you're selling fashion, electronics, or digital products, Alertify adapts to your business needs.

== Features ==

* **Easy-to-use notification button** for out-of-stock products, letting customers subscribe to stock updates.
* **Customizable email templates** to match your store’s branding and style.
* **Rate limiting** to avoid overwhelming your customers with too many email notifications.
* **Customer waitlist management** to keep track of subscribers and offer exclusive restock notifications.
* **Mobile-friendly design** for a smooth user experience on all devices.
* **AJAX-powered forms** for seamless notifications without page reloads.
* **Unsubscribe functionality**, allowing customers to opt-out of notifications with ease.
* **Supports WooCommerce variable products**, ensuring compatibility with both simple and variable product types.
* **Lightweight and optimized for performance**, ensuring minimal impact on store speed and user experience.

== Installation ==

1. **Install via WordPress Plugin Directory:**
   - Go to your WordPress admin panel and navigate to Plugins > Add New.
   - Search for **Alertify** and click **Install Now**.
   - After installation, click **Activate** to enable the plugin.

2. **Manual Installation:**
   - Upload the plugin files to the `/wp-content/plugins/alertify` directory on your server.
   - Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' screen in WordPress.

3. **Configuration:**
   - After activation, go to **WooCommerce > Alertify** to configure the plugin settings, customize email templates, and manage your back-in-stock notifications.

== Frequently Asked Questions ==

= Does this work with variable products? =

Yes, **Alertify** supports both simple and variable products. Customers can subscribe to individual product variations and will receive notifications for specific variants when they are back in stock.

= How do customers subscribe to out-of-stock products? =

The plugin automatically adds a customizable "Notify Me" button on out-of-stock product pages. Customers can click this button to subscribe for restock notifications.

= Can I customize the email templates? =

Yes, **Alertify** allows you to fully customize the email templates sent to customers. You can adjust the content, styling, and structure to match your store's branding.

= How does rate limiting work? =

Rate limiting ensures that customers don't receive too many email notifications in a short time frame. You can configure this limit in the plugin settings to avoid spamming customers.


